#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD9702 expect=violation domain=ADAE
#note "PRESENCE half of the ONTRTFL pair: the indexed flag ONTR01FL is in the dataset but the overall ONTRTFL column is not present at all. The value rules (ONTRTFL in Requirements.Variables.All) take a dataset SKIP here, so without this rule the absence goes unreported -- that is why this rule was minted."
#expectViolationCount 1
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADAE structure=OCCDS subclass=AE
col STUDYID  type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col ASEQ     type=Num
col AEDECOD  type=Char
col ONTR01FL type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | 1 | HEADACHE | Y
